### Topic 44 - Task API (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ---------- Reading ----------

### First page (default size 10, sorted by id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks

### Second page, 5 per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?page=1&size=5

### Filter + sort: HIGH priority TODO tasks, earliest due date first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?status=TODO&priority=HIGH&sort=dueDate,asc

### Search in the title
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?search=demo

### Sort by two fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?sort=priority,desc&sort=dueDate,asc

### One task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/1

### ---------- Writing ----------

### Create (201 Created + Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn OpenAPI",
  "description": "Read topic 44 and try Swagger UI",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-31"
}

### Create with Idempotency-Key. Send it TWICE: 1st = 201, 2nd = 200 with the same id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7f9c1d2e-0b1a-4c55-9f00-1234567890ab

{
  "title": "Pay the invoice",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Replace (PUT = send everything)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write API documentation (OpenAPI)",
  "description": "Use springdoc",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2030-02-15"
}

### Partial update (PATCH = send only what changes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### Delete (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/12

### ---------- Errors (all in ProblemDetail format) ----------

### 404 - unknown id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/999

### 400 - validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "dueDate": "2000-01-01"
}

### 400 - unknown enum value
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?status=SLEEPING

### 400 - unknown sort property
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks?sort=colour,asc

### ---------- Versioning ----------

### v2 (URI versioning) - compact shape
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/tasks?size=3

### Header versioning - default (v1 shape)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Header versioning - v2 shape
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
X-API-Version: 2

### ---------- Docs ----------

### OpenAPI JSON for group v1
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs/v1
